@startuml
' Figure 20.8  The grant travels with the question
' Reading order: top to bottom. The caller's signed grant goes with the
' question; the guard verifies it and filters to the caller's desks.
' The agent's service account never widens what the caller may read.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
participant "Team\nlead" as U <<org>>
participant "Agent" as A <<model>>
participant "Guard" as G <<policy>>
participant "Warehouse" as W <<ops>>
U -> A : question,\ngrant
A -> G : query,\nsame grant
G -> G : verify;\ndesks CHI-2, CHI-3
G -> W : desk IN\n(CHI-2, CHI-3)
W --> G : two desks
G --> A : rows
A -> G : refund value
G -[$FAIL]-> A : refused:\nneeds finance
@enduml
